# DECISIONS — slice S01 (and the mission's gap table). Append-only: one line per decision, `date · question · choice · reason · who ruled`.

## The gap table — intake §10 items (a)–(e), re-measured by REQ-PES

Every verdict below was re-measured in the lane
`/Users/vladmihaimiron/Documents/DebateAIRO/dialectical-engine/.worktrees/pes-base/dialectical-engine`
@ 776359c3 on 2026-09-24, with the commands in the right-hand column. Nothing here is trusted from
